        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 63,
        "step_number": 1,
        "text": "Step 1: Determine the possible remainders when dividing by 4 and by 5.\n- When dividing by 4, the possible remainders are 1, 2, 3.\n- When dividing by 5, the possible remainders are 1, 2, 3, 4."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 471,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 472,
        "char_start": 193,
        "effective_step": 2,
        "end_token_index": 131,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 132,
        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Identify the total number of outcomes.\n- There are 3 possible outcomes for the first spin (remainder when divided by 4).\n- There are 4 possible outcomes for the second spin (remainder when divided by 5).\n- Therefore, there are \\(3 \\times 4 = 12\\) total possible outcomes."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 782,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 783,
        "char_start": 474,
        "effective_step": 3,
        "end_token_index": 295,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 296,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: List all possible combinations of remainders and their corresponding squares on the checkerboard.\n- (1,1) -> (3,1)\n- (1,2) -> (3,2)\n- (1,3) -> (3,3)\n- (1,4) -> (3,4)\n- (2,1) -> (4,1)\n- (2,2) -> (4,2)\n- (2,3) -> (4,3)\n- (2,4) -> (4,4)\n- (3,1) -> (5,1)\n- (3,2) -> (5,2)\n- (3,3) -> (5,3)\n- (3,4) -> (5,4)"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 900,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 902,
        "char_start": 785,
        "effective_step": 4,
        "end_token_index": 343,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 344,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Identify which of these squares are shaded.\n- Shaded squares are at (3,1), (3,3), (4,2), (4,4), (5,1), (5,3)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 976,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 977,
        "char_start": 904,
        "effective_step": 5,
        "end_token_index": 362,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 363,
        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: Count the number of shaded squares.\n- There are 6 shaded squares."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 1149,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 1151,
        "char_start": 979,
        "effective_step": 6,
        "end_token_index": 408,
        "near_end": true,
        "prefix_token_count": 409,
        "step_number": 6,
        "text": "Step 6: Calculate the probability of landing on a shaded square.\n- Probability = Number of favorable outcomes / Total number of outcomes = \\( \\frac{6}{12} = \\frac{1}{2} \\)."
      }
